              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na bhoono, uni Nebhugatinesa nkögönga ndë, ngötogia ndë na gösööka Ömögambi wa kuriöbha. Gikugira amakora gaae gonsui na agö öbhöheene, nawe ngusuukiirria arë abhaikumburi.”",
          "type": "text",
